From b33a1a9b5ff7cf8bbb564b1d0025d500a77963c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dcasati <dcasati@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 14:44:31 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 10/11] tests: add LinuxKPI wlan, MHI, QMI and regulatory test
 harnesses

Kernel test modules and bring-up harnesses used during development.
The MHI harness carries its own copy of the WCN7850 CE and register
tables (wcn7850_tables.c, ce_config.h) so the vendor sources stay
unmodified.

Local only.  Candidates for conversion to ktest(9) with ATF wrappers
before going upstream.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
